  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice fennel.\n• In a medium microwave-safe bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch sliced fennel in your hands, then add to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover fennel. Microwave fennel, in 30 second bursts, until warmed through. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-afa72000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While fennel is pickling, in a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Roughly shred baby cos lettuce.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine dill & parsley mayonnaise and Greek-style yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-b6f10310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook ciabatta, tossing, until golden and slightly crispy, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic and another drizzle of olive oil, tossing until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-a2145d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi, then pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add the honey and a squeeze of lemon juice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-430a6030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled fennel.\n• To the bowl with croutons, add pickled fennel, cucumber, cos lettuce, a good squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-f3f4f640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pickled fennel crouton salad between bowls. Top with honey haloumi and drizzle over herby dressing. Sprinkle with everything garnish (see ingredients).\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f848b3cade9b9f0ace1698/step-649c9d50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
